  "description": "Casual Men’s Fashion Figure | 30 Poses\nCreate modern menswear sketches faster with this collection of 30 casual men’s fashion figure poses for Procreate.\nDesigned for fashion designers, fashion students, illustrators, apparel brands, and creative professionals, this brush set features natural and versatile male fashion figures that are ideal for casualwear, streetwear, contemporary menswear collections, lifestyle fashion concepts, portfolio development, and client presentations.\nThe Casual Collection focuses on relaxed everyday poses that help designers visualize garments in realistic and wearable situations while maintaining professional fashion proportions.\nSimply stamp a pose onto your canvas, lower the opacity, create a new layer, and begin designing immediately.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n• 30 Casual Men’s Fashion Figure Poses\n• Procreate Brush Set (.brushset)\n• High-Quality Male Croquis Templates\n• Installation Guide\n• Preview Images\nPERFECT FOR\n• Fashion Designers\n• Fashion Students\n• Fashion Illustrators\n• Apparel Brands\n• Menswear Designers\n• Procreate Users\n• Digital Artists\nUSE FOR\n• Menswear Design\n• Casualwear Development\n• Streetwear Design\n• Fashion Sketching\n• Fashion Illustration\n• Collection Planning\n• Portfolio Development\n• Client Presentations\n• Digital Fashion Design\nFEATURES\n• 30 Casual Men’s Fashion Figure Poses\n• Professional Menswear Proportions\n• Relaxed Everyday Poses\n• Easy Stamp Workflow\n• Time-Saving Design Resource\n• Optimized for Procreate\n• Perfect for Beginners and Professionals\nCOMPATIBILITY\nCompatible with Procreate for iPad.\nPlease ensure that Procreate is installed before purchasing.\nPLEASE NOTE\nThis is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.\nABOUT HYDNSTUDIO\nHYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Casual Men’s Fashion Figure | 30 Poses</p>\n<p>Create modern menswear sketches faster with this collection of 30 casual men’s fashion figure poses for Procreate.</p>\n<p>Designed for fashion designers, fashion students, illustrators, apparel brands, and creative professionals, this brush set features natural and versatile male fashion figures that are ideal for casualwear, streetwear, contemporary menswear collections, lifestyle fashion concepts, portfolio development, and client presentations.</p>\n<p>The Casual Collection focuses on relaxed everyday poses that help designers visualize garments in realistic and wearable situations while maintaining professional fashion proportions.</p>\n<p>Simply stamp a pose onto your canvas, lower the opacity, create a new layer, and begin designing immediately.</p>\n<p>WHAT’S INCLUDED</p>\n<p>• 30 Casual Men’s Fashion Figure Poses<br>\n• Procreate Brush Set (.brushset)<br>\n• High-Quality Male Croquis Templates<br>\n• Installation Guide<br>\n• Preview Images</p>\n<p>PERFECT FOR</p>\n<p>• Fashion Designers<br>\n• Fashion Students<br>\n• Fashion Illustrators<br>\n• Apparel Brands<br>\n• Menswear Designers<br>\n• Procreate Users<br>\n• Digital Artists</p>\n<p>USE FOR</p>\n<p>• Menswear Design<br>\n• Casualwear Development<br>\n• Streetwear Design<br>\n• Fashion Sketching<br>\n• Fashion Illustration<br>\n• Collection Planning<br>\n• Portfolio Development<br>\n• Client Presentations<br>\n• Digital Fashion Design</p>\n<p>FEATURES</p>\n<p>• 30 Casual Men’s Fashion Figure Poses<br>\n• Professional Menswear Proportions<br>\n• Relaxed Everyday Poses<br>\n• Easy Stamp Workflow<br>\n• Time-Saving Design Resource<br>\n• Optimized for Procreate<br>\n• Perfect for Beginners and Professionals</p>\n<p>COMPATIBILITY</p>\n<p>Compatible with Procreate for iPad.</p>\n<p>Please ensure that Procreate is installed before purchasing.</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE</p>\n<p>This is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.</p>\n<p>ABOUT HYDNSTUDIO</p>\n<p>HYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.</p>",
